OL,3,ARolls-Royce gas leak prompts emergency
OL,4,Aresponse
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services have responded to a
OL,7,Fgas leak at a Rolls-Royce factory in
OL,8,FDerby.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fit was called to the site in Raynesway
OL,12,Fat about 15:40 GMT on Thursday.
OL,14,FIt said police, fire crews and
OL,15,Fambulances responded to a "small
OL,16,Fchemical and gas leak", adding this was
OL,17,F"not a nuclear incident", and all
OL,18,Femployees were accounted for.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
