OL,3,ARolls-Royce gas leak prompts emergency
OL,4,Aresponse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 300m (985ft) cordon was put in place
OL,7,Fand locals were asked to remain indoors
OL,8,Fwith windows and doors shut, however
OL,9,Fthe guidance was lifted shortly before
OL,10,F22:00 GMT.
